  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Data for Transformative Education: PAL Network&apos;s Common Learning Assessment for Foundational Learning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project work entails conducting a common assessment in 15 member countries to provide national level estimates of foundational learning for children, comparable at the global level. This assessment data shall be harnessed and leveraged for advocacy and action initiatives, thereby driving positive impact, and enhancing the salience of FLN in the global south region.</narrative>
  </description>
